<title>UK: Britain's Siebe makes two acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Britain's Siebe makes two acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Siebe Plc said on Thursday that it has made two acquisitions which would expand its presence as a supplier of tubular fluid systems and controls for the automotive sector.</p>
<p>It has bought the tube production line of Carl Froh Gmbh for 5.2 million stg in cash and Australian automotive engineering firm P J King for 2.8 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
